   "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968502091691736*^9, 3.9685021047541447`*^9}},
 CellLabel->
  "In[268]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6ceade84-59b8-4d4f-9e43-6c149b59c85b"],

Cell["\<\
As one can see, the CNOT gate transforms the state into an entangled state.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968752894339135*^9, 
  3.968752911423148*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d309eb6d-1c00-4368-b247-\
54c5fd898ad8"],

Cell["\<\
C0-NOT (or C0-X) flips the target qubit when the control qubit is in the 0 \
state.\
\>", "Text",
