Cell["\<\
Another important 3-qubit gate is Fredkin gate. It is also called CSWAP gate \
because it is conditional SWAP gate that conditionally exchanges two qubits. \
It is used in swap-test, data movement, and reversible sorting/comparison.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.969302963496352*^9, 3.969303006983128*^9}, {
  3.9693030923512163`*^9, 
  3.969303116161838*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a8b70a4e-3232-4e5a-a764-\
